# Essentials

- No git commits without explicit permission. File edits are fine; running `git commit` needs the user to say so.
- Operation-specific routing lives in the per-area rules under `.cursor/rules/` — let the rule for the area you're touching fire and load the memory-bank files it names.
- `memory-bank/_index.md` is the inventory of what exists in DMB — consult it when navigating or when authoring a new rule, not as a runtime step on every operation.

## Writing into `memory-bank/`

Follow `memory-bank/project/doc-guide.md` for style, length, and hygiene before editing any memory-bank file.

